  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Stabilization through Durable Return Solutions, Governance and Livelihood Development in the Lake Chad Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention increases access and greater quality of services (including education and health) through supporting the relevant line ministries, the local authorities and the communities to rehabilitate local infrastructures in Chad. Overall, the project contributes to improved governance as it employs a transparent, participatory and accountable decision-making process bringing the local governments and community members together to create a more inclusive system. Acknowledging that resilience cannot be reached without gender equality, the project has a transversal gender approach, addressing inequalities by systematically promoting women&#x2019;s equal participation in decision making and activities.</narrative>
  </description>
